{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e19d14dea8bb4790bf73658b75b8b31d05a280454f0bb0f41ecbc32ce83f785c", "ja": "（エターナルハーモニーのライブ、最高だったな。\n次はどんなライブを……ん？）", "zh": "（『Eternal Harmony』的演唱会，真是精采绝伦。\n下次要举办什么样的演唱会呢……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1001_hitodakari", "source_sha256": "9843ec3299e5607255c26f11e7ae5b27c30675c12961542ce378429b27ab76ba", "ja": "ワーッ！　ヒュー、ヒューッ！", "zh": "哇──！咻──咻──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ba588212f1609618b59ebdad6962a8a2e8d84cf4e2d622bd06c0b495e12bdaca", "ja": "なんだ？　ずいぶん盛り上がってるみたいだけど……\nって、あれはジュリアか？　なにをしてるんだ？", "zh": "怎么啦？好像很热闹的样子……\n话说，那是茱莉亚吗？她在做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "1fe76ceef72b11dec9d0e947b59fd9aa7d756855230ad962c46b686b743c2073", "ja": "イェーイッ！\nみんな、聴いてくれてありがとなー！", "zh": "耶～！\n大家，谢谢你们的聆听──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "805eed78ec4324eb963d98b40048b069a617942350fc54a93a0e573cfffd6c84", "ja": "……おっ、{$P$}！\nよさげなバンド見つけたから、ちょっと飛び入りでな♪", "zh": "……哦，{$P$}！\n我发现一个感觉很棒的乐团，就中途加进去凑个热闹♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1005_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "1f9a4e653a4ec5dd2bef20e636dc58a890c689c01a0c23e65fd33030287e14bc", "ja": "イェーイッ！\nオイ、そこのあんたも！　イェーイッ！！", "zh": "耶～！\n喂，那边那位也一起来吧！耶～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1006_p", "source_sha256": "08e95d42a52fbca4c1f31cfe35c57cd8afb5e5ef9c4407d89d53912d5cd941d2", "ja": "え、ああ……い、イェーイッ！", "zh": "咦，好……耶、耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "337508aff5550039bc2c4f13aab2532e36816602dc9b304c3dad655be884f951", "ja": "あはは！　ありがとう、ジャマしたな。\nあんた達、意外にやるじゃないか。サイコーだったぜ！", "zh": "哈哈！谢啦，打扰你们了。\n没想到你们挺有两下子的，超棒的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1008_rojobandman", "source_sha256": "ff5891d5c632d981a14e8e1d7b4fd9256935f7a590a15a7faa4dc9ddf9ae9fa8", "ja": "ああ、そっちもな！\n……こないだは、その、悪かったな。またやろうぜ！", "zh": "谢啦，你也是啊！\n……之前那件事，呃，真抱歉。下次再一起表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "069fac8a5028c51238ed760e84f3b42a9301ca2129c5d2a316d3673c42473d05", "ja": "っと……お疲れ、{$P$}。\nふふん、ロックなあたしのライブも悪くないだろ？", "zh": "呼……辛苦了，{$P$}。\n哼哼，我摇滚的演唱会也不赖吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cf010fc7059d72908b4b9d8a81f04978dc9be6ffc10e5589d84d95f00c085465", "ja": "ああ、良かったよ。というか、\nまた絡まれてるのかと思って焦ったけどな。", "zh": "嗯，很精采喔。\n话说，我本来还担心你是不是又被纠缠了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "643c765b455c8d42f03ffe0471915b79a4418d801de057043a266b93d488bb0b", "ja": "ん？　ああ、そうだったな。\nあの時は、心配かけて悪かったな。", "zh": "嗯？哦哦，我想起来了。\n抱歉那时候让你担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "82919815b6ed15c4269c45915361a84b26dececbe0c5774c80af5a2c66940d4f", "ja": "あたしは、何言われたっていいんだけど。\nみんなを悪く言われたら、無性に腹が立ってさ……。", "zh": "我自己被怎么讲都无所谓，\n但是听到大家被人中伤，就让我莫名火大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b98452c723eb2550411a4f2bd670eae9a5f0f9ae010e9a07dfb3670076ba56dc", "ja": "気持ちはわかるけど……危ない事はやめてくれって、\n一応言っておくよ。そういう時は、俺を頼ってくれ。", "zh": "我懂你的心情……但我还是得提醒你别以身犯险。\n遇到状况的时候，就向我求助吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "a46d5b2334e481f68606c4587305073568d9ecfa9345a49562c23f12e29ceb63", "ja": "わかった、わかった。……でも、\nそう言うあんただって、ちょっとキレてなかったか？", "zh": "知道了，我知道了嘛……\n不过，虽然你这么说，当时也是有点动怒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_1015", "source_sha256": "44088199210531eb0da5ffe36651ad169cf8387a61d54fb4001d7cc55a82692e", "ja": "キレていません", "zh": "我没有动怒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_2000_p", "source_sha256": "61a2a8f454b1b17172e5043b33de2b8fe3a16eb269b3e2293f0a6493d94473d1", "ja": "いや、全然キレてなんかないよ。\n平常心だった。", "zh": "不，我完全没有动怒喔。\n我保持着平常心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_2001_050jul", "source_sha256": "8b04f05f00f27570616c2f0edddb7e57ce6f9bcd5c94dcc42ac01bfa19b6694e", "ja": "ホントかよ……？\nま、次からはもっとクールにやるさ♪", "zh": "真的假的……？\n算了，下次我会更冷静帅气地搞定♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_2002_p", "source_sha256": "97014f4bf8c21f2a19870235e4901855f6f82589e89f6fe5da82c05c8141f542", "ja": "そうしてくれ。……あ、それともうひとつ。\nジュリアに言っておきたいことがある。", "zh": "就拜托你这么办……啊，然后还有一件事。\n我有话想对你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_2003_050jul", "source_sha256": "79505d9fd3ac2214ef828e090ebc818a6ecb80d42f74a7df3348528faa563b07", "ja": "な、なんだよ、急にマジな顔して……。\n勝手に路上ライブやったら、マズかったとか？", "zh": "什、什么啊，怎么突然露出那么认真的表情……\n难道是私自在街头办演唱会不太好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_2004_p", "source_sha256": "c0fe28edfba6a38264f267c00a8cefdcfda6e2dc1648c53e4de3c0a49f33736c", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて。さっきの歌、\n途中からだったから。全部聞きたかったなって。", "zh": "不，不是那样。\n刚才的歌我只听到后半，所以希望你能让我听完整版。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_2005_050jul", "source_sha256": "b01d10bb03928794866913d2a824da618631a17505f65e1f293dfeaf69f736fd", "ja": "はぁ！？　言っておきたいコトって、そんなコトかよ！\n……あー、もう。", "zh": "啊！？你说有话想说，结果居然是这种事！\n……哎～真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0063_2006_050jul", "source_sha256": "cf0e1978457d7e8f1c6149d3fa9c5ef736181b3c75d8f0aabdd80149010c3f19", "ja": "あ……あんたのリクエストなら、\n別にいつだって歌ってやるっての！　このバカP！", "zh": "既……既然是你点的歌，\n那我无论何时都会唱给你听啦！你这个笨蛋P！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
